  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/zipball/v3.1.8",
  "body": "## Pulse Music v3.1.8 (OTA Update for Android & Windows)\n\n### \ud83d\ude80 Update Engine & CDN Prioritization\n- CDN Prioritization (cdn.jsdelivr.net & raw GitHub) completely eliminates GitHub API 60-req/hr rate limiting (403 errors on shared mobile carrier CGNAT IPs).\n- 64-bit ID & Asset Deserialization: Full support for GitHub 64-bit integer IDs and multi-gigabyte asset sizes, permanently eliminating 'Server Error 200' crashes.\n- Resilient Content-Type handling for raw text/plain payloads, eliminating NoTransformationFoundException.\n- Friendly error notifications: Clear, graceful UI alerts replacing cryptic raw HTTP status codes.\n\n### \ud83c\udfb5 Enhanced Lyrics Accuracy & Quality\n- Strict title & artist normalization prevents irrelevant song lyrics from being matched.\n- Empty lyrics filtering: Completely eliminates blank or placeholder lyrics cards from playback screens.\n\n### \ud83c\udf10 Listen Together Latency & Reconnection\n- Fixed coroutine cleanup race condition preventing secondary room connections.\n- Purged stale room tokens on leave/disconnect to ensure immediate room rejoin.\n- Reduced handshake and socket timeouts for faster session initialization.\n\n### \u26a1 General Performance & Stability\n- Polished stability across Android & Windows platforms."
